# ENT alone does nothing.
press f1
shot S1-ENT-alone
down f1
down f2
sleep 1200
shot S1-hold-bar
sleep 2400
wait W1
up f1
up f2
sleep 1500
shot W1-list
press down
press down
press down
press down
press down
press down
shot W1-look-again-lit
press up
press up
press up
press up
press up
press a
wait W2
shot W2-keyboard
press a
press right
press a
press x
shot W2-page-ABC
press a
press x
shot W2-page-symbols
press down
press down
press down
press down
shot W2-action-row
press start
shot W2-start-under-8-does-nothing
press up
press a
press a
press a
press a
press a
press a
press b
press a
shot W2-eight-typed
press start
wait W3
shot W3-joining
press esc
wait W4
shot W4-on-wifi
press esc
wait W1
shot W1-after-join
press esc
wait S1
# From the pot, too.
press coin
wait A1
down f2
down f1
sleep 3300
wait W1
up f1
up f2
shot W1-from-the-pot
press esc
wait S1
shot S1-end
